The discharge summary (Ex.P8) issued by the Government Medical College Hospital,
Villupuram, shows that the claimant has sustained the following injuries :
i. Laceration in right foot 2 x 6 x 3 cm ;
ii. Laceration in right little finger 5 x 3x 2 cm ;
iii. Fracture in 2nd 3rd 4th metatarsal / 5th proximal and middle phalanx and comminuted fracture in 5th metacarpal neck.
